You've always got the gloomiest
look on your face, old man.

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:26.830
What kind of a greeting is that?

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:29.790
When you're at somebody's house,
you don't stand, you sit.

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:31.830
So, what's your take?

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:35.950
He skipped a button on his clothes, right?

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:38.830
So the lover is the killer!

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:41.790
No, the girl's lover is innocent.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:43.500
Huh? Why's that?

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:46.370
The lover in the photos on her phone

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:51.160
is nothing like my profile
of the killer, you see.

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:53.500
What's a "profile"?

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:54.080
What's this?

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:54.080
What's a "profile"?

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:54.830
What's this?

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:54.830
Does it taste good?

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:56.910
What? It's mystery-solving <i>rakugo</i> .

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:56.910
It's not food, fool.

00:17:56.910 --> 00:17:59.870
He's terrible at it, though.

00:17:56.910 --> 00:17:59.870
It's a logically derived induction.

00:17:59.870 --> 00:18:01.870
Mystery-solving <i>rakugo</i> ?

00:17:59.870 --> 00:18:01.870
A what?

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:07.290
But what kind of girl takes off her clothes
in front of a man she's never met?

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:09.870
I'd love to meet her.

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:14.790
You're a fool. When a girl takes off
her clothes in front of a strange man,

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:17.580
it's because she's selling herself.

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:20.580
White Rose!

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:23.080
Then the killer works there?

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:26.450
That would be right.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:31.200
Um, what's this about the killer's profile?

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:33.160
Well you see...

00:18:33.160 --> 00:18:35.580
Well above 180cm in height.

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:39.620
Looks well-off, but has a job
that pays a low salary.

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:42.370
Their one pleasure is cigars.

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:46.200
And the nail on their right
index finger is quite long.

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:47.620
That about does it.

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:51.160
How do you figure that they're
well above 180cm in height?

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:55.620
You can see from the space between
the footsteps that were left on the floor.

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:59.370
Then what about the low salary?

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:02.540
There was cigar ash on the floor.

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:07.040
It was cheap stuff, and was
smoked down to a stub.

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:11.250
They act like they're wealthy,
but that's not how a rich man smokes.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.830
And the long nail on the right index finger?

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:17.160
Those wings drawn in blood, remember?

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:22.950
There were a lot of scratches in the part
drawn by the right index finger.

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:25.660
I see. It's not Jack, then.

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:27.870
How can you tell?

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:31.700
The other wings were
drawn with lots of blood.

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:35.200
But this one was drawn
immediately after her death,

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:36.790
when the flow of blood had stopped,

00:19:36.790 --> 00:19:39.120
and there wasn't enough.

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:41.200
The scratches came when they were

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:45.000
trying to get the blood
to spread out far enough.

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:50.910
They're here.

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:51.750
Who's that?

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:53.700
The killer, of course.

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:15.410
Looks like somebody completely different...

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:16.620
How rude!

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:20.910
You were the ones who
called me out here at this hour.

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:23.950
Who the hell's this guy?

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:26.000
The owner of the White Rose, Masaya- <i>san</i> .

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.700
"White Rose Owner"

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.700
The owner of the White Rose, Masaya- <i>san</i> .

