"White Rose Owner"

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:29.370
While he was having his fun with
the girls who passed his interview,

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:32.120
While he was having his fun with
the girls who passed his interview,

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:36.700
his assistant was helping
himself to the leftovers.

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:40.080
How did you know about that?

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:41.790
Why not follow him?

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:43.660
It'll be fun.

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:45.160
Bye!

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:48.250
What the heck's going on here?

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:56.500
Old man! This smell!

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:59.290
Yes. It's Bahamas.

00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:03.200
You there. Lend me a light?

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:09.790
Thanks.

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:21.950
Old man, is this the killer?

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:25.870
You're so stupid...

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:28.120
You just figured that out?

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:38.000
He'd been having his way with the girls
that failed Masato's interviews.

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:41.250
And tonight, he called
the victim to that room,

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:43.750
lying about it being an interview.

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:48.160
He tried to rape her, like always...

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:50.290
But she resisted.

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:53.200
And he killed her.

00:22:02.830 --> 00:22:06.540
And then he made it look like Jack did it.

00:22:21.830 --> 00:22:23.000
Sheesh.

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:25.540
Looks like that was a waste of effort.

00:22:28.370 --> 00:22:29.500
Why?

00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:37.080
So basically, the killer was
a fake pretending to be Jack?

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:47.000
How is a fake murderer like a fish?

00:22:47.000 --> 00:22:48.950
I don't know, how?

00:22:48.950 --> 00:22:53.000
They're both in big trouble if they get caught!

00:22:53.000 --> 00:22:57.540
I'm afraid that's all we have time for today--

00:23:03.330 --> 00:23:05.750
Sherlock- <i>san</i> !

00:23:07.580 --> 00:23:09.540
"Chauffeur Arrested, Faked Murder
To Look Like Jack the Ripper"

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:19.790
Oh, no...

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:22.450
You can use this room for a while.

00:23:22.450 --> 00:23:24.290
Thank you.

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:26.660
I'll do whatever errands you need done...

00:23:26.660 --> 00:23:27.540
Yes?

00:23:27.540 --> 00:23:30.290
Yes. Anything you want.

00:23:33.500 --> 00:23:36.200
You're a doctor, right?

00:23:36.200 --> 00:23:38.080
Yes, that's right...

00:23:38.080 --> 00:23:41.330
I need a favor...

00:23:41.330 --> 00:23:43.580
Move! Oh, no...

00:23:43.580 --> 00:23:44.790
"Baldy"

00:23:45.450 --> 00:23:47.910
Oh, no. Stay away.

00:23:47.910 --> 00:23:49.660
Stay away!

